.TH ALI-VAULT 1 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ali-vault \- AES-256 file vault on Terry's Dice
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ali-vault lock
.I file
.br
.B ali-vault unlock
.I file.vault
.br
.B ali-vault list
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B lock
rolls a dice data key, encrypts the file, wraps the key with your
password (PBKDF2) and shreds the original.
.B unlock
reverses it; a wrong password raises a Sentinel ALERT.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR terry-dice (1),
.BR ali-passgen (1)
